For each read, store:
- dup = flags & 0x400
- sec = flags & 0x100
- supp = flags & 0x800
- rev = flags & 0x10
- start, end (ref span)
- mapq
- tlen abs
- base_at: dict ref_pos -> (base, qual, read_idx)
- deletions: list of (del_start_1based, len) and deleted sequence
